Local changes: the MIME mapping is restricted to DTS, DTS Express, and DTS-HD, all
mapped to FFmpeg's DCA decoder. The JNI wrapper is dynamically linked to the existing
FFmpeg 9.0-series shared libraries packaged in app/libs/mpvlib.aar. The MPVFlow arm64
build pins FFmpeg n9.0.2. That runtime is built with --disable-gpl --disable-nonfree
--enable-version3 and carries LGPL-3.0-or-later;
no GPL or nonfree decoder is added by this module.
